window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>(Prophecy Series Book 1—A historical fantasy of magic, sisterhood and vampires in Victorian England)</p> <p>When witches stand together, anything is possible.</p> <p>England, 1845. The Harris family is steeped in old magic, a secret kept hidden for generations. Jane’s magic may be the key to an ancient vampire prophecy that could change the course of history—or doom her to an eternity haunted by a dark hunger.</p> <p>Jane is raised to be the perfect debutante—a lady meant for duty and quiet obedience. Forced into an arranged marriage with a cold and calculating man, she quickly learns that her new husband's cruelty may be the death of her.</p> <p>But a bigger threat is on the horizon. As a dark shroud envelopes Jane's world, a powerful coven of women embraces her. Together, they will face the looming threat of her husband and vampiric domination. But time is running out.</p> <p>As she navigates a world of powerful witches, ruthless vampires, and secrets buried beneath the gaslit streets, Jane must decide: Is she willing to fight for her freedom, even if it means embracing the darkness inside?</p> <p>For fans of Deborah Harkness, Anne Rice, Susanna Clarke, Silvia Moreno-Garcia, and Grady Hendrix. Never Yours—The Prophecy Series—is a gripping blend of sisterhood, magic, slow-burn romance, and ancient secrets set in a Gothic Victorian England.</p>"; 
